    "answer": {
      "short": "\\$7529.40",
      "worked": "Four weeks is two fortnights.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{4 weeks’ pay} &= 3204\\times2 = \\$6408\\\\\\text{Holiday loading} &= 0.175\\times6408 = \\$1121.40\\\\\\text{Holiday pay} &= 6408+1121.40 = \\$7529.40\\end{align*}$$",
